        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DRB4004BRPVC, Contemporary Sliding Pocket Door Privacy Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Pocket Door Privacy Lock has a built-in edge pull so you can pull the door from its pocket. This Privacy Function Pocket Door Lock is normally used on bathroom and bedroom doors because it can offer some degree of privacy. Simply turn the lock on the interior. The Darby Privacy Pocket Door Lock can be easily unlocked from the outside via the emergency release; as a result, it does not offer security, only privacy. The privacy set includes a strike plate for the lock arm, 2 flush pulls mounted to a lockable edge pull housing, and all the mounting hardware for doors 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese Contemporary Style Pocket Locks are also available as a <a href=\"/products/contemporary-pocket-door-passage-set-first-impressions-drb4004brpsg\"><b>Passage Lock Set</b></a> and a <a href=\"/products/contemporary-pocket-door-flush-pull-first-impressions-drb4004004br\"><b>Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions DRB4004BRPVC Contemporary Pocket Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DRB06-specifications.pdf?v=1704262225\"><b>First Impressions DRB4004BRPVC Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged as a set that includes 2 flush pulls, flip out edge pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Pocket Door Privacy Lock",
                "description": "The Contemporary Pocket Door Privacy Lock has a built-in edge pull so you can pull the door from its pocket. This Privacy Function Pocket Door Lock is normally used on bathroom and bedroom doors because it can offer some degree of privacy. Simply turn the lock on the interior. The Darby Privacy Pocket Door Lock can be easily unlocked from the outside via the emergency release; as a result, it does not offer security, only privacy. The privacy set includes a strike plate for the lock arm, 2 flush pulls mounted to a lockable edge pull housing, and all the mounting hardware for doors 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick.\r\n",
